    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Binary writer backed by an owned memory buffer. All bytes are accumulated in an internal std::vector&lt;uint8_t&gt;. Supports optional parallel writes via an internal thread pool after the buffer has been pre-allocated with pre_allocate(). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
